  - m_Id: 3136817844899840
    m_Localized: Welcome to Flick Curling!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817857482752
    m_Localized: In Flick Curling you flick go stones to get them closer to the centre
      of the house than your opponent's.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817857482753
    m_Localized: You and your opponent take turns throwing one stone each.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817857482756
    m_Localized: When the end is over, you score one point for each of your stones
      closer to the centre than your opponent's closest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817857482757
    m_Localized: Now let's see how to throw a stone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817857482758
    m_Localized: Below the min line, drag left or right on the left of the stone
      to change the direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817857482759
    m_Localized: Drag up or down on the right of the stone to set the power, and
      let go to throw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677056
    m_Localized: Touch above the min line to aim straight at that spot. Drag and
      the aim follows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677058
    m_Localized: Tap to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677059
    m_Localized: Skip the tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677060
    m_Localized: Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677061
    m_Localized: Skip the tutorial?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677062
    m_Localized: It won't be shown again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677063
    m_Localized: Keep going
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677064
    m_Localized: Skip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677065
    m_Localized: Tutorial complete
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677066
    m_Localized: Now take on the AI and players online!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3136817861677067
    m_Localized: Let's go
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3162040900177920
    m_Localized: A stone that doesn't cross the min line, or goes all the way past
      the out line, doesn't count and is removed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3994885692510208
    m_Localized: Your turn now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3994885776396288
    m_Localized: The side that throws first starts with a bonus guard in front of
      the house, to make up for the other side having the last stone. Now beat the
      AI!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139051982442496
    m_Localized: The Game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579840
    m_Localized: Goal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579841
    m_Localized: Flick your stones closer to the centre of the house than your opponent's.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579842
    m_Localized: Ends
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579843
    m_Localized: A match has {ends:plural:{} end|{} ends}. In each end, Black and
      White take turns, {shots:plural:{} stone|{} stones} each.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 4139052028579844
    m_Localized: Winning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579845
    m_Localized: The higher total score after the last end wins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579846
    m_Localized: Tie
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579847
    m_Localized: One extra end is played. Still level, it's a draw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579848
    m_Localized: The Sheet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579849
    m_Localized: Launch spot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579850
    m_Localized: Every stone is thrown from the middle at the bottom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579851
    m_Localized: Min line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579852
    m_Localized: A thrown stone has to get past this line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579853
    m_Localized: House
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579854
    m_Localized: The rings at the top. The closer to the centre, the better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579855
    m_Localized: Out line
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579856
    m_Localized: The line behind the house. A stone all the way past it is out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579857
    m_Localized: Side walls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579858
    m_Localized: Stones may bounce off the side walls, but not beside the out line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579859
    m_Localized: Controls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579860
    m_Localized: Direction
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579861
    m_Localized: Below the min line, drag left or right on the left of the stone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579862
    m_Localized: Power
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579863
    m_Localized: Drag up or down on the right of the stone. The longer the pull,
      the harder the throw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579864
    m_Localized: Throw
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579865
    m_Localized: Let go of the power finger to throw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579866
    m_Localized: Quick aim
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579867
    m_Localized: Touch above the min line to aim right there. Drag and the aim follows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579868
    m_Localized: Cancel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579869
    m_Localized: Move the pulling finger to the left of the stone and it won't throw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579870
    m_Localized: Void Shots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579871
    m_Localized: Short
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579872
    m_Localized: A thrown stone that doesn't fully cross the min line doesn't count.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579873
    m_Localized: Out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579874
    m_Localized: Any stone all the way past the out line is removed, even one knocked
      there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579875
    m_Localized: Time
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579876
    m_Localized: You have {seconds} seconds a turn. When the fuse over the min line
      burns out, you lose that stone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 4139052028579877
    m_Localized: Scoring
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579878
    m_Localized: When
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579879
    m_Localized: Points are counted once every stone of the end has been thrown.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579880
    m_Localized: Which stones
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579881
    m_Localized: Only stones touching the house count.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579882
    m_Localized: Who scores
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579883
    m_Localized: Only the side with the stone closest to the centre scores.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579884
    m_Localized: Points
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579885
    m_Localized: One for each of your stones closer than the opponent's closest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579886
    m_Localized: Blank end
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579887
    m_Localized: If the house is empty or the closest stones are level, nobody scores.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579888
    m_Localized: Turn Order
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579889
    m_Localized: Going second
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579890
    m_Localized: The side going second throws the end's last stone, which is an advantage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579891
    m_Localized: First end
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579892
    m_Localized: Both sides throw one stone at once at a target placed somewhere
      on the sheet; the closer one goes second. Level, it's decided at random.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579893
    m_Localized: Next ends
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579894
    m_Localized: The side that scored goes first. After a blank end, going second
      passes to the other side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579895
    m_Localized: Bonus guard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4139052028579896
    m_Localized: The side going first starts with a stone in front of the house,
      on top of the {shots} it throws.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4297768082125881571
  - m_Id: 4162172798029824
    m_Localized: Remove Ads
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4162172890304512
    m_Localized: Ads have been removed!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4162172890304513
    m_Localized: Owned
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4162172890304514
    m_Localized: Pending
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4162172890304515
    m_Localized: 'Can''t reach the store.

      Please try again later.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4162172890304516
    m_Localized: 'Your purchase is waiting for approval.

      It will be applied
      once approved.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4162172890304517
    m_Localized: 'The purchase didn''t go through.

      Please try again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4163776012013568
    m_Localized: Restore Purchases
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4163776070733824
    m_Localized: Your purchases have been restored.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4163776070733825
    m_Localized: 'Couldn''t restore your purchases.

      Please try again later.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4168660052529152
    m_Localized: Opponent
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4181914246107136
    m_Localized: Takeout!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4181914363547648
    m_Localized: Double Takeout!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4181914363547649
    m_Localized: Triple Takeout!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4183663379927040
    m_Localized: Vibration
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4183663468007424
    m_Localized: On
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4183663468007425
    m_Localized: Off
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4260592254636032
    m_Localized: Throw at the target!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4260592384659456
    m_Localized: "Waiting for the opponent\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4275301687152640
    m_Localized: 'A match starts with the turn order shot: both sides throw one stone
      at this target at the same time, and whoever gets closer throws last.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
